    "thesisStatement": "The accelerating digitization of global finance—driven by fintech disintermediation, artificial intelligence, cross-border real-time payment rails, and distributed ledger technology—is democratizing capital access and revolutionizing commercial velocity, yet simultaneously introducing profound systemic vulnerabilities including acute cyber-fragility, algorithmic systemic risks, deep regulatory fragmentation, and the threat of permanent digital financial exclusion across the Global South.",
