      "   C. The Programmability Paradox: Targeted fiscal transfers and automated subsidies versus dystopian financial surveillance and negative interest rate enforcement",
      "   D. The Death of Cash and Total Privacy Erosion: The elimination of anonymous transactions and the state's power to freeze or cancel dissident wealth at a keystroke",
