      "   A. Dollarization via Stablecoins: Citizens in hyperinflationary emerging economies (Argentina, Nigeria, Turkey) adopting dollar stablecoins, eroding local monetary policy",
      "   B. Financial Inclusion vs. State Paternalism: Can CBDCs successfully onboard the informal sector without subjecting it to predatory taxation?",
      "   C. Sanctions Circumvention and Asymmetric Warfare: The utility of crypto-rails and non-Western CBDCs in neutralizing unilateral Western financial coercion",
      "VI. Regulatory Frameworks and the Emerging Monetary Synthesis",
      "   A. The European Union's MiCA (Markets in Crypto-Assets): Codifying reserve auditing and consumer protections for stablecoin issuers",
